    "note": "Portola Week (official Goldenvoice afters program, announced 2026-08-18: 21 shows Thu Sept 24 - Sun Sept 27; presale Aug 20, general Aug 21) added as an \"Afters\" section, and Folsom Street Fair weekend as a \"Folsom\" section, 2026-08-23. Mechanism: an afters/Folsom appearance is its own entry; when the name matches a lineup artist (Overmono, Fatboy Slim, ...) the pick/aura/notes unify by exact name on purpose - one artist, one pick, cards in both sections. Night + venue ride in `stage`, hours in `time`; cards render them as a sub-label. Horse Meat Disco (the crew ask - Bearracuda Folsom Street party, confirmed Fri Sept 25, Public Works, 9 PM-3 AM, 21+, tickets sickening.events; NOTE a stale 2024 Tixr link circulates - IDs are sequential, 114080 is the 2024 edition) is day-tagged \"Afters & Folsom\" so it renders under both. Curation: title-billed artists and lineup artists get cards; supporting-roster DJs noted here instead: Rory Phillips (w/ 2manydjs), Boygirl + Femme Jatale b2b Erika (w/ Six Sex), Kaytree + a program audio loft (Public Works Sun), Kavari (The Midway Sun), Buck Wilson (Monarch Sun), Mateo Segade (HMD upstairs). Sourcing: egress-proxied research - facts come from ticketing-page titles/search listings (AXS/Eventbrite/Tixr/venue calendars) cross-checked in aggregate; HMD, fair date/hours, Magnitude, DEVIANTS, Real Bad 37, and Groove Armada (Sat, The Great Northern) were re-verified individually 2026-08-23. Times not confirmed anywhere yet: Fcukers/Chloé Caillet (Public Works Sat), Groove Armada, Max Styler/Airwolf Paradise + Azzecca (Audio) - cards carry venue only until they post (venue norm ~10 PM). DESPACIO Pier 80 Friday is limited to every-year passholders. No unofficial/renegade afters existed as of 2026-08-23 - they historically appear 2-4 weeks out; re-scan mid-September. Folsom fair stage/DJ talent also unannounced yet (folsomstreet.org posts closer in). Weekend-conflict map for planning: Fri is conflict-free (HMD night); Sat daytime Folsom events run opposite Portola day 1; Magnitude/PERVERT XXL start as day 1 ends; Sun daytime the fair runs opposite Portola day 2; DEVIANTS/Real Bad overlap the Sunday afters."
